Notice how these "letters," (if you can even call them that) utilize
negative space to appear as, well, letters. I didn't draw anything here
that wasn't some weird blob or strange form. A parallel I'd like to draw is
that we can choose to make the most of a negative experience. Sometimes,
(as with the above message) we can even find something meaningful or
beautiful from negativity.

A lot of the there are things that happen around us that seem out of our
control, or things maybe we feel we shouldn't try and influence. In those
times, it helps me to think about things from the perspective of the
Savior. He knows and loves everyone individually! When I try to look at
others with Christ-like love, my heart is softened, and I feel that I can
make the most out of those negative times.

I'd absolutely encourage all of you beloved friends and family to try this
out in your own life! There are a lot of frustrating, depressing, and
exhausting experiences that we have throughout our day-to-day. Next time
you're feeling that negativity, (in whatever form it may take) turn
outwards with love for others, and re-evaluate your previous thoughts and
desires. Who knows, maybe things will just magically work out =F0=9F=98=89 =
I belive
that often when things "work out" it's thanks to the Spirit, whom we can
invite as we seek to be righteous and caring!

Give it a try! If you have any experience with this I'd love to hear about
it from you! =F0=9F=98=81

If anyone's curious, I had a pretty good Christmas and week leading up to
it. We had the chance to participate in the Branch Christmas party, and
like all of our friends showed up! So awesome. Also did some good service
for a lady in the Branch. Not anything extremely crazy as of late, I will
continue with my weekly summary email style next week, just felt like
trying something new =F0=9F=98=89

Love you guys!! You can tell I love you all, right?? Then imagine just how
much God and Jesus love literally everyone and your mind will probably
explode =F0=9F=A4=AF
Just know that you are all loved =F0=9F=98=84

